              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When your truck is your livelihood, every decision you make comes down to one thing: reliability. You don't have time for guesswork, and you definitely don't have time for breakdowns caused by the wrong parts.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "That's why choosing OEM International truck parts isn't just a preference; it's a long-term business decision. At Sun State International, we've worked with owner-operators and fleet managers across Florida long enough to know what matters most. You need parts that fit right, perform consistently, and keep your truck on the road where it belongs.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-what-are-oem",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "What Are OEM International Truck Parts?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "what-are-oem"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-are-oem-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "OEM stands for \"Original Equipment Manufacturer.\" That means International truck OEM parts are built specifically for your truck by the same company that designed it. These aren't generic replacements. They're engineered to match your truck's exact specifications, ensuring:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-what-are-oem-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Proper fit and alignment"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Consistent performance"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Long-term durability"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-are-oem-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you browse an international truck parts catalog, OEM parts are the ones designed to work seamlessly with your system, not just \"fit well enough.\"",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-what-are-oem-4-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
