                {
                  "id": "h-long-term-value",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The Long-Term Value of OEM Parts",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "long-term-value"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-long-term-value-1",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "1. Better Reliability = Less Downtime",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "reliability"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-long-term-value-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Downtime is one of the biggest threats to your business. Every hour your truck is off the road is money lost. OEM international truck parts reduce the risk of unexpected failures because they're built to perform under the same conditions your truck was designed for. Unplanned downtime can cost fleets hundreds of dollars per day per truck, depending on lost revenue and delays. That's why cutting corners on parts rarely pays off in the long run.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-long-term-value-3",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "2. Designed for Your Truck, Not Just \"Compatible\"",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "designed-for-your-truck"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-long-term-value-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Aftermarket parts are often built to fit multiple models. That flexibility can lead to compromises. International OEM parts, on the other hand, are designed with precision. Every component works in sync with your engine, drivetrain, and systems. That means:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "list-long-term-value-5",
                  "type": "prose-list",
                  "props": {
                    "ordered": false,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Less wear and tear"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Improved fuel efficiency"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Fewer repeat repairs"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-long-term-value-6",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "3. Protects Your Investment",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "protects-investment"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-long-term-value-7",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Your truck isn't just equipment. It's your business. Using the right international parts helps maintain the integrity of your vehicle over time. That can impact:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "list-long-term-value-8",
                  "type": "prose-list",
                  "props": {
                    "ordered": false,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Resale value"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Warranty protection"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Long-term performance"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-long-term-value-9",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Cutting costs upfront with cheaper parts often leads to higher repair costs down the line.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
