                },
                {
                  "id": "p-role-of-service-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Parts are only one piece of the equation. Proper installation and maintenance matter just as much. Even the best international OEM parts won't perform the way they should if they're installed incorrectly or not maintained over time. That's why having a dependable service partner matters. At Sun State International, parts and service go hand in hand. Our goal isn't just to sell you a part. It's to make sure your truck is ready for the road ahead.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
